  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learning for health development: an outlook of recent practices of EU cooperation in Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;specific objectives&lt;/strong&gt; for this evaluation are&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;a. Understand the performance of the interventions;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Understand the quality of results achieved by the Implementing Partners, the enabling factors and those hampering a proper delivery of results with special emphasis on the political economy of training and learning for the Libyan health sector.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
